  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USADF Coffee Initiative 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USADF Coffee Program is a multi-stakeholder initiative that accelerates the development of East African coffee enterprises through a combination of grants, capacity building and value chain services. This USADF signatory approach is designed and implemented in 6 countries: Burundi, Tanzania, Uganda, Rwanda, the Democratic Republic of the Congo and Malawi and aims to address the major challenges cooperatives in East Africa face.</narrative>
  </description>
